{"ref":"BDB, אֶלְיָדָע","hw":"אֶלְיָדָע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְיָדָע</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God knows</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, דְּעוּאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_דְּעוּאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">דְּעוּאֵל</a>, Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אלידע</span> Hal 209<strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  son of David <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.16\">2 S 5:16</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.8\">1 Ch 3:8</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בעלידע</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.7\">1 Ch 14:7</a> which perhaps read here, cf. Dr<sup>Sm</sup>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  father of an adversary of Solomon <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:23\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.23\">1 K 11:23</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  chief of Benjamin <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.17\">2 Ch 17:17</a>.","next":"BDB, אֵלִיָּה","prev":"BDB, אֱלִידָד"}